    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>THE LAST EARTH FIGHTER\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfae</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN ATMOSPHERIC CINEMATIC SHOOT 'EM UP GAME...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The last defender of Earth\u2026 but sometimes, hiding is wiser than shooting.&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>\ud83d\udccc Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Six unique environments</strong>, each with its own gameplay twist \u2014 from deep space and scorching deserts to underwater worlds and humanity's shattered remains.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Reflexes meet strategy</strong> \u2014 dodge, hide, time your movements, solve environmental puzzles, and find your path through danger.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 <strong>Dynamic level design</strong> \u2014 from narrow laser corridors to falling boulders and shifting cave systems, every chapter tests a different skill.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A story of survival and resistance</strong> \u2014 be the last hope of a dying Earth and confront the alien force that brought humanity to its knees.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive soundtrack and ambient audio</strong> \u2014 tailored to each environment to heighten tension and atmosphere.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>An epic finale</strong> \u2014 destroy the alien energy core and end the invasion once and for all.\u00a0 </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Enjoy cinematic sequences between levels</strong> \u2013 dive deeper into the story as you progress through each unique world.\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\ude80 Drift through the silent void of deep space, dodging meteors and unseen threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/ec3d4a0085642124c158f2b83b50d3af.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2601\ufe0f Lose yourself in endless cloud seas where enemies vanish into mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/184abd4c1bc867d4fd07483b759099c4.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f Cross abandoned deserts, where the wind whispers of battles long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/39b86f756d81b76719bea570acc1254f.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a Sink into the dark, cold depths of underwater worlds, where danger waits in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/668b15696238f689a943677e38e3af27.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea8 Navigate the claustrophobic echoes of forgotten caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/95aa1e6eb49d9bacabc25463135a63d2.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Rise above the shattered mega-cities for the ultimate showdown \u2014 Earth's final stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/c765b062390b4c81feead8fd10fdd15e.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6\u00a0<strong>IN GAME ACHIEVEMENTS\u00a0</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>Track Your Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/f9c5c9384fbfe3ba12a3ec659ce77fbd.avif?t=1749023742\" data-has-big width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the unknown across the stars and earth? Unlock unique achievements as you battle your way through waves of alien threats and uncover deep mysteries:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Contact</strong> \u2013 Kill the first enemy wave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Space Contact</strong> \u2013 Destroy rotating enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien in Space</strong> \u2013 Successful contact with alien lifeforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Balloons</strong>- Puncture 28 Space Balloons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UFOs in the Clouds</strong> \u2013 UFOs have been destroyed in the clouds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invisible UFOs</strong> \u2013 Stealth UFOs taken down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumping Robots Seen</strong> \u2013 Banished the jumping robots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain Guardians</strong> \u2013 The mountain guardians were defeated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contact with Underwater Enemies</strong> \u2013 Submarines were sunk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contact with Submarines</strong> \u2013 Submarines eliminated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania Detected</strong> \u2013 The Metroidvania threat was neutralized.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mines Are Everywhere</strong> \u2013 Cleared the field of mines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cave Has Echoes</strong> \u2013 Enhanced the cave\u2019s mysterious echoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Towers Are Following Us</strong> \u2013 All towers have collapsed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passed Through the Metropolis</strong> \u2013 Reclaimed the city from alien forces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your achievements anytime and start fresh on your journey through the stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A PERFECT GAME FOR YOU</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six\u00a0difficulty level, pick ups, auto fire, and other accessibility options, you'll be able to enjoy a relaxing exploration experience or a punishing Bullet Hell session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is waiting for you...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>THE LAST EARTH FIGHTER\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfae</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN ATMOSPHERIC CINEMATIC SHOOT 'EM UP GAME...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The last defender of Earth\u2026 but sometimes, hiding is wiser than shooting.&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>\ud83d\udccc Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Six unique environments</strong>, each with its own gameplay twist \u2014 from deep space and scorching deserts to underwater worlds and humanity's shattered remains.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Reflexes meet strategy</strong> \u2014 dodge, hide, time your movements, solve environmental puzzles, and find your path through danger.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 <strong>Dynamic level design</strong> \u2014 from narrow laser corridors to falling boulders and shifting cave systems, every chapter tests a different skill.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A story of survival and resistance</strong> \u2014 be the last hope of a dying Earth and confront the alien force that brought humanity to its knees.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive soundtrack and ambient audio</strong> \u2014 tailored to each environment to heighten tension and atmosphere.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>An epic finale</strong> \u2014 destroy the alien energy core and end the invasion once and for all.\u00a0 </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Enjoy cinematic sequences between levels</strong> \u2013 dive deeper into the story as you progress through each unique world.\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\ude80 Drift through the silent void of deep space, dodging meteors and unseen threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/ec3d4a0085642124c158f2b83b50d3af.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2601\ufe0f Lose yourself in endless cloud seas where enemies vanish into mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/184abd4c1bc867d4fd07483b759099c4.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f Cross abandoned deserts, where the wind whispers of battles long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/39b86f756d81b76719bea570acc1254f.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a Sink into the dark, cold depths of underwater worlds, where danger waits in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/668b15696238f689a943677e38e3af27.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea8 Navigate the claustrophobic echoes of forgotten caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/95aa1e6eb49d9bacabc25463135a63d2.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Rise above the shattered mega-cities for the ultimate showdown \u2014 Earth's final stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/c765b062390b4c81feead8fd10fdd15e.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6\u00a0<strong>IN GAME ACHIEVEMENTS\u00a0</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>Track Your Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/f9c5c9384fbfe3ba12a3ec659ce77fbd.avif?t=1749023742\" data-has-big width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the unknown across the stars and earth? Unlock unique achievements as you battle your way through waves of alien threats and uncover deep mysteries:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Contact</strong> \u2013 Kill the first enemy wave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Space Contact</strong> \u2013 Destroy rotating enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien in Space</strong> \u2013 Successful contact with alien lifeforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Balloons</strong>- Puncture 28 Space Balloons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UFOs in the Clouds</strong> \u2013 UFOs have been destroyed in the clouds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invisible UFOs</strong> \u2013 Stealth UFOs taken down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumping Robots Seen</strong> \u2013 Banished the jumping robots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain Guardians</strong> \u2013 The mountain guardians were defeated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contact with Underwater Enemies</strong> \u2013 Submarines were sunk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contact with Submarines</strong> \u2013 Submarines eliminated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania Detected</strong> \u2013 The Metroidvania threat was neutralized.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mines Are Everywhere</strong> \u2013 Cleared the field of mines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cave Has Echoes</strong> \u2013 Enhanced the cave\u2019s mysterious echoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Towers Are Following Us</strong> \u2013 All towers have collapsed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passed Through the Metropolis</strong> \u2013 Reclaimed the city from alien forces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your achievements anytime and start fresh on your journey through the stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A PERFECT GAME FOR YOU</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six\u00a0difficulty level, pick ups, auto fire, and other accessibility options, you'll be able to enjoy a relaxing exploration experience or a punishing Bullet Hell session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is waiting for you...</p>",
